            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Asthma is a chronic reversible respiratory disease characterized by inflammation and bronchial smooth muscle contraction. The therapeutic approach must improve the acute symptoms, avoid disease exacerbations and prevent the pulmonary functional decay.</AbstractText>
